# code-review.json Schema

```json
{
  "status": "passed|failed|blocked",
  "generatedAt": "ISO-8601 timestamp",
  "scope": {
    "files": ["审查的文件路径"],
    "risksReviewed": ["RISK-P0-001"],
    "blindSpots": ["因文件不可达无法审查的区域"]
  },
  "findings": [
    {
      "id": "CR-001",
      "severity": "P0|P1|P2|P3",
      "category": "correctness|concurrency-design|maintainability|code-comment-accuracy|test-coverage|security|permission|data-consistency",
      "file": "文件路径",
      "line": 100,
      "summary": "一句话发现描述",
      "failureScenario": "具体的触发条件和后果",
      "recommendation": "具体的修复建议",
      "verdict": "CONFIRMED|PLAUSIBLE"
    }
  ],
  "readinessConstraints": [
    "CR-001（P1）建议在下一轮迭代修复但本轮不阻塞..."
  ],
  "residualRisks": [
    "RISK-P0-001 并发验证仍是空白..."
  ]
}
```

## Severity 分级

- **P0/P1**：资金、安全、权限、数据一致性、并发缺陷 → 标记为 **blocking**
- **P2**：代码规范、注释准确性、可维护性 → 非阻塞
- **P3**：测试覆盖补强建议 → 非阻塞
